<http://modellingdh.github.io/ont/odp/term/isEngagedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Because an activity may engage other participants than the one performing it, engagements are in general considered individual rather than collective, therefore each participants has their own engagement and only some of them will be conscious and/or documented."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
